        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 8561CCMRKWH, Conical White Marble Knob with Wilshire Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe White Marble Knob with Wilshire Rose has a classic look that is perfect for traditional homes. This knobset is made from real white marble and is paired with the traditional Wilshire Rose for which you can select your favorite finish. The Conical White Marble Knob with Wilshire Rose is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-CC-speecifications.gif?v=1704354555\" width=\"519\" height=\"297\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Emtek Conical Knob Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Emtek Select Wilshire Rose with White Marble Conical Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li>Knob is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass knob and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the White Marble Conical Knobset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Base Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Material: Marble</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4 - 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-cc-Specification.pdf?v=1704262419\"><b>Emtek Select Conical Knob Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door knobs on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside knob will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>This mix-match style knob is totally customizable. If you need a different finish combination or a different rose style, <a href=\"/pages/contact\"><b>Contact Us</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-levers-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354533\" width=\"599\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
